From kimai-cTYGs6MY1n4q5t9Oc1ygMg at public.gmane.org  Thu Mar 10 03:11:29 2011
From: kimai-cTYGs6MY1n4q5t9Oc1ygMg at public.gmane.org (Kosuke Imai)
Date: Wed, 09 Mar 2011 22:11:29 -0500
Subject: Re: exact vs mahalanobis
