Message-ID: <alpine.OSX.2.00.1103092208570.42757@pol-g88381xtxyl.princeton.edu>

No.  Please see the matchit docs for this.  mahalanobis distance is a 
measure of similarity; it summarizes many variables using one number. 
Exact matching is a procedure that matches units which have identical 
covariate values.

Kosuke

